# Conclusion

This project successfully delivered a modular, interactive, and extensible scanning tool that consolidates key early-stage penetration testing techniques into a Python script.

The script’s automation features reduce human error, save time, and provide consistent output. It’s ideal for SOC analysts, red teamers in training, and cybersecurity students.

With user-friendly features such as automatic wordlist handling, early exit on success, keyword search, and full result archiving, the script is a practical and educational security tool.

